              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino mumwaka wamakumi otatwe amusanu aumwi wabwami bwaAsa, Basa mwami wa-Israyeli wakeza kuzoolwisya ba-Juda. Nkabela wakayaka Rama kuti atazumizyi muntu naba omwe kunjila nanka kuzwa kuli-Asa mwami wa-Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Asa wakagwisya insiliva angolida muziyobwedo zyaŋanda ya-Jehova amuŋanda yamwami, watuma kuliBenihadadi mwami wa-Aramu iwakakede ku-Damasko, wati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuli cizuminano akati kesu, mebo ayebo, ataata auso, Bona! Ndakutumina insiliva angolida. Koya, ukamwaye cizuminano cako ncotangene a-Basa mwami wa-Israyeli, kuti andileke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Benihadadi wakaswiilila majwi aamwami Asa, watuma basilutwe bampi nzyaakajisi kuyoolwisya minzi yaba-Israyeli, nkabela bakazunda Iyoni, a-Dani, a-Abelimaimu, aminzi yoonse yaziyobwedo mucisi ca-Nafitali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Basa amvwe buyo, wakaleka kuyaka Rama, akulesya milimo yawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo mwami Asa wakeza aba-Juda boonse, nkabela bakagwisya mabwe aa-Rama, azisamu zyawo, Basa nzyaakali kuyasya, baziyasya Geba a-Mizipa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
