        {
          "text": "Nkaambo Jehova, meso aakwe alalanga-langa moonse munyika, kuti aliyumye kukugwasya abo balulama mumoyo kumeso aakwe. Lino wacita bufubafuba mumakani aya, nkaambo kuzwa sunu ulajana inkondo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.9"
            ]
          }
